WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:17,950
The Master often said that it is better for a thin person to fish than to use a thin person to fish.

2
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:20,630
But I think this is not necessarily objectionable

3
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:27,620
Senior Brother Xu, what new realm did he read from the book this time?

4
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,460
Thin people use fish to focus on the future

5
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:33,420
Thin people use fish to solve their current difficulties

6
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,940
One talks about the long term, the other doesn’t.

7
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:39,340
They all have their own uses, so how can we simply compare them together?

8
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:43,450
What does Senior Brother Song think?

9
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,290
Senior Brother Xu’s words are wrong.

10
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:48,450
How long can a full meal last? There is always time to finish the fish.

11
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:51,450
If you don’t learn how to make a living, you’ll be in a hurry

12
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:56,040
It's just a few more days

13
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:58,320
But if you can't even pass the hurdle in front of you,

14
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:04,810
No one can survive, so what can we talk about in the long run?

15
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:08,550
People from the Xu family are used to showing off with a few words of truth.

16
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:10,070
Junior Sister Lu, what are you going to do?

17
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:33,360
Neither of those two senior brothers can convince the other.

18
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:35,600
Why don't you find someone to verify it?
